[
  {"comment": "Envelopes (mitcad#1271). An inverted U frame (Box1 F1, d1-d3; Body1): a 200 mm block with a 100 mm tunnel cut under it (Box2 F2) and 5 mm holes through its top plate and its legs (Cylinder1-3 F3-F5)."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": {"type": "origin", "plane": "xy"},
    "corner": [0, 0], "length": 200, "width": 200, "height": 200, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": {"type": "origin", "plane": "xy"},
    "corner": [50, 0], "length": 100, "width": 200, "height": 150, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F1.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder", "plane": {"type": "origin", "plane": "xy"},
    "center": [100, 50], "diameter": 5, "height": 200, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F1.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder", "plane": {"type": "origin", "plane": "xy"},
    "center": [100, 150], "diameter": 5, "height": 200, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F1.b0"]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder",
    "plane": {"type": "fixed", "origin": [0, 0, 0], "normal": [1, 0, 0], "x_axis": [0, 1, 0]},
    "center": [100, 75], "diameter": 5, "height": 200, "operation": "cut", "participants": ["F1.b0"]}},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 1, "body": "Body1", "volume": 4996073.009, "tolerance": 1e-6,
    "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [200, 200, 200]}}},

  {"comment": "Its envelope at a detail size of 20 mm (Envelope1 F6, d13): the holes are closed over, the tunnel stays open, so it is the U without holes, 5 000 000 mm³, of ten planar faces (top, the legs' bottoms, the outer and inner sides, the tunnel's ceiling, front and back) and few triangles. A new body named after the feature; the frame stays as it was."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "envelope", "bodies": ["F1.b0"], "detail": 20}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Envelope1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 2, "body": "Envelope1", "volume": 5000000,
    "faces": 10, "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [200, 200, 200]}, "tolerance": 1e-6,
    "max_triangles": 200}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body1", "volume": 4996073.009, "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "bodies"}, "result": [{"name": "Body1"}, {"name": "Envelope1", "envelope": true}]}},

  {"comment": "It follows the frame: the block 260 high, its top plate 110 thick."},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "d3", "value": 260},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Envelope1", "status": "ok", "body": "Envelope1", "volume": 7400000,
    "faces": 10, "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [200, 200, 260]}, "tolerance": 1e-6}},

  {"comment": "A closed box with an inner cavity (Box3 F7 100 mm about the xy plane, Box4 F8 a 40 mm box cut inside it; Body2): its envelope (Envelope2 F9) is the box without the cavity."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": {"type": "origin", "plane": "xy"},
    "corner": [400, 0], "length": 100, "width": 100, "height": 100, "symmetric": true, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": {"type": "origin", "plane": "xy"},
    "corner": [430, 30], "length": 40, "width": 40, "height": 40, "symmetric": true, "operation": "cut",
    "participants": ["F7.b0"]}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body2", "volume": 936000, "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "envelope", "bodies": ["F7.b0"], "detail": 20}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Envelope2", "status": "ok", "body": "Envelope2", "volume": 1000000, "faces": 6,
    "bbox": {"min": [400, 0, -50], "max": [500, 100, 50]}, "tolerance": 1e-6}},

  {"comment": "A machine in a component of its own placed 500 mm along y (Machine, O1; Box5 F10 in it): an envelope of the occurrence in the root (Envelope3 F11) wraps its bodies where the occurrence places them."},
  {"cmd": "create_component", "name": "Machine", "transform": {"translation": [0, 500, 0]}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "box", "plane": {"type": "origin", "plane": "xy"},
    "corner": [0, 0], "length": 100, "width": 50, "height": 40, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "activate_component", "component": "Root"},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "envelope", "occurrence": "O1", "detail": 20}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Envelope3", "status": "ok", "body": "Envelope3", "volume": 200000, "faces": 6,
    "bbox": {"min": [0, 500, 0], "max": [100, 550, 40]}, "tolerance": 1e-6}},

  {"comment": "No bodies to wrap: an empty component's occurrence fails the feature; undone."},
  {"cmd": "create_component", "name": "Empty", "activate": false},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "envelope", "occurrence": "O2"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Envelope4", "status": "error", "error_contains": "no bodies to wrap"}},
  {"cmd": "undo"}
]
